{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into an office building where murders frequently occurred.<br>The elevator keeps sending you back to the 0th floor \u2014 find the pattern behind the rising floors, control the lights, and beware of dangerous colors.<br>Reach the 10th floor and escape the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short horror game inspired by <i>The Exit 8</i> and its film adaptation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game features <strong>31 anomalies</strong> and <strong>2 endings</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong><br>WASD - Move<br>Shift - Run<br>F - Inspect<br>ESC - Pause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are welcome to stream or record gameplay as long as the game\u2019s title is included.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Escaped from the 0th floor.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4148290/5cec6c4be13111bf00d4a95d23820c8c6561b1c2.jpg"},{"name":"Unconventional Path","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4148290/fc3be6ca73dfe3437f69de1c573f17e289cb8002.jpg"},{"name":"What Is This?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4148290/13d28e95498daf94f3085826ff2e19a2e0e4dafa.jpg"},{"name":"Walk Toward Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4148290/1cf52ae6ee38ff1a6c91d2e7b8c6cdf7ebe44a70.jpg"},{"name":"EXIT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4148290/6fb9a74db0ed04518620f5354b0b50f4286be7e9.jpg"},{"name":"TRUE-EXIT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4148290/5d4aa750cd82b96cdeb0f4433bf863d1bdd6b9e9.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4148290?t=1763625849","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.ste